"test":{"name":"script-new-functions-3","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"scriptNewFunctions3","question":"More scenario functions (Act 1, mission 6): Attack Repulsed (a weak Blue squad attacks a Red squad in the forest and comes off worse: counted for Killed By Blue, not Red); Unit Killed's Killer Kind (a Red squad killed by a Blue tank counts for Tank, not Artillery); Spawn Unit At Unit {unit} (made where the dead squad fell); Spawn Unit Target (a squad made aboard a helicopter over the water); a forced boarding order puts a squad aboard where the rules give no way in; Units At Most 0 with Ready Only (none of Blue's units left able to act).","rules":"standard"},
